<TextPage title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How commercial links are labeled and kept separate from scoring.">
  <p>Uncensored Index may earn a commission when a reader purchases through a marked affiliate link. The reader’s price should not change because of that link.</p>
  <h2>What commissions cannot buy</h2><ul><li>A higher benchmark score.</li><li>A better rank.</li><li>Removal of a failed test.</li><li>Suppression of a correction.</li><li>Access to private user data.</li></ul>
  <p>Every commercial relationship is disclosed before the first commercial link on a page. Sponsored content is labeled and kept outside editorial scoring.</p>
</TextPage>
